<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou heav’nly Brightness, Light divine,</l><l>O deep within my heart now shine,</l><l>And make Thee there an altar.</l><l>Fill me with joy and strength to be</l><l>Thy member, ever joined to Thee</l><l>In love that cannot falter;</l><l>Toward Thee longing</l><l>Doth possess me; turn and bless me;</l><l>Here in sadness</l><l>Eye and heart long for Thy gladness.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
